So it's not seeing the tpm2-abrmd TCTI:
tcti-default=3Dtcti-device

SWTPM won't change anything.

So what is the output of:
pkg-config --libs tss2-tcti-tabrmd
?

and the output of:
ldconfig -v 2>/dev/null | grep -v ^$'\t'

the tcti is installed into /usr/local/lib, perhaps your tcti is a non-stand=
ard location and not getting
picked up by the loader.

